<title>MEXICO: HSBC Hldgs to pay about $300 mln for Serfin stake.</title>
<headline>HSBC Hldgs to pay about $300 mln for Serfin stake.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Grupo Financiero Serfin said on Tuesday it agreed in principle to sell 19.9 percent of the banking group to HSBC Holdings Plc for about $300 million.</p>
<p>Serfin's director general Adolfo Lagos announced the sale during a news conference in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((--Henry Tricks, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565))</p>
</text>
